The DNA was extracted from the stool and oral wash samples using the PowerSoil DNA Extraction Kit (MO BIO Laboratories, Carlsbad, CA). The libraries for metagenomics sequencing were constructed from the extracted DNA and sequenced by the NCI LICI Microbiome and Genetics Core (NCI Bethesda). The stool and oral wash microbiome data were obtained using shotgun metagenomics with a target sequencing depth of 20 million reads. Illumina paired fastqs for each sample were processed using the JAMS package version 1.9.7
